# Quote form delivery.
#
# Without this, the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail app, which
# silently fails on phones with no mail client configured — the lead is lost
# and nobody finds out. Set this in production.
#
# Get the ID from the Formspree form endpoint: the endpoint looks like
# https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz — the ID is the part after /f/.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=
